MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialScene_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 100000000001
    m_Localized: This is a scene from the past. It will help you reconstruct the
      event and uncover the truth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000002
    m_Localized: This is the spread area. You can place cards from your hand here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000003
    m_Localized: "Since your spread was perfect\u2014both the required number and
      suit matched\u2014you receive an additional clue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000004
    m_Localized: Excellent! Now I will explain how to perform the spread to glimpse
      into the past. Do you see the crystal ball? It has changed color and revealed
      a number. Using the cards, you must fulfill the condition it indicates.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000005
    m_Localized: Great! Look, the number of your spread matches the number in the
      crystal ball. And the dominant suit of the cards matches the color of the ball.
      That means well done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000006
    m_Localized: Take the second card of coins and place it in the spread zone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000007
    m_Localized: Here is your current spread result. Just adjust it so that this
      number matches the number in the crystal ball.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000008
    m_Localized: "To perform the spread and glimpse into the past, you will need
      these cards \u2014 they read traces invisible to the eye."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000009
    m_Localized: "Allow me to introduce myself \u2014 Madame Quacking. My cards will
      reveal not just your fate, but a story hidden within the patterns."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000010
    m_Localized: At any moment, you can open the scroll of rules to remind yourself
      how everything works here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000011
    m_Localized: Try placing this green card in the spread zone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000012
    m_Localized: "These are your cards. Each has its own value and suit\u2014but
      more on that later."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000013
    m_Localized: "Excellent! As you can see, the cards are highlighted \u2014 this
      means the special rule of this suit has been fulfilled. Highlighted cards double
      their value."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000014
    m_Localized: "And one final tip for the future: to reach the required number,
      you don\u2019t always need to place a card in the perfect position. Good luck!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000015
    m_Localized: Press the button to confirm your spread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000016
    m_Localized: an imminent meeting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000017
    m_Localized: "Make the correct spread, and the true picture of the past will
      be revealed to you. Keep in mind that you don\u2019t always need to use all
      the cards in your hand.\n\nI will help you this first time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000018
    m_Localized: "Pay attention to the color of the mirror. It indicates the dominant
      suit in the spread. To receive a hint, make the mirror\u2019s color match the
      color of the crystal ball."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000019
    m_Localized: Draw cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000020
    m_Localized: 'Now about the suits. There are 4 in the game: <color=#387545>Coin</color>,
      <color=#EB1C24>Rose</color>, <color=#ffbd00>Crown</color> and <color=#5691b4>Skull</color>.
      Each suit has its own special property in a spread.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000021
    m_Localized: Look at the scroll of rules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000022
    m_Localized: Also includes how each suit works.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000023
    m_Localized: 'Suit: Coins

      If a Coin card is next to another Coin, its
      value is doubled.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000024
    m_Localized: The number needed to win each round can be viewed here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000025
    m_Localized: The color of the mirror shows your dominant suit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000026
    m_Localized: 'Suit: Roses

      Cards are doubled if placed between any two
      cards (including cards of the same suit).

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000027
    m_Localized: "Suit: Crowns \nCards are doubled if they are not adjacent to other
      Crown cards."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000028
    m_Localized: 'Suit: Skulls

      Cards at the edges of the spread double their
      value.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000029
    m_Localized: read the spread
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000030
    m_Localized: the rules
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000031
    m_Localized: the color of the ball shows the suit required for this round
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 100000000032
    m_Localized: track your score here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313344549691392
    m_Localized: the main menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313408500244480
    m_Localized: back to the story
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
